I definitions.inc

# push：非快进失败时对远程零增量——指针不动，且不复制任何对象
# 本地分叉前的准备：本地与远程各有独立提交
> init
<<<
+ a.txt mcur.txt
> add a.txt
<<<
> commit "local work"
<<<

C remote
> init
<<<
+ b.txt mgiven.txt
> add b.txt
<<<
> commit "remote work"
<<<
C
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

# 推送被拒
> push origin master
Please pull down remote changes before pushing.
<<<

# 远程 global-log 仍只有 initial 与 remote work 两块，local work 未被复制过去
C remote
> global-log
${COMMIT_LOG}
${COMMIT_LOG}
<<<*

# 远程 master 指针未动：沿指针的 log 最新块消息仍是 remote work
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
remote work

===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
